  "notes": "Combines ⟦{発|はつ}→〜発：04026_hatsu⟧ (issue) + {布|ふ} (spread, announce). The formal proclamation of a law, ordinance, or constitution to the public. A formal word, common in historical contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{憲法|けんぽう}→憲法：02744_kenpou⟧{発布|はっぷ}: promulgation of a constitution\n- ⟦{法令|ほうれい}→法令：13299_hourei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{発布|はっぷ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to promulgate a law\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{公布|こうふ}→公布：08394_koufu⟧: promulgation — the standard modern legal term for officially announcing a law\n- ⟦{施行|しこう}→施行：06581_shikou⟧: enforcement; coming into effect — when a promulgated law actually takes effect",
